   Ciencias Nucl; Inst Politecn Nacl, Ctr Invest \& Estudios Avanzados;
   Inst Nacl Invest Nucl; Soc Mexicana Fis; Consejo Nacl Ciencia \& Tecnol;
   Ctr Latinoamer Fis},
Abstract = {For even-even isotope and isotone nuclei described by the interacting
   boson model a geometric description is found. This geometric
   interpretation is made in the essential parameter space determined by
   the catastrophe theorly. The energy surfaces associated to the effective
   IBA Hamiltonian for the Ru, Ba, Sm, Cd, Os, Pt, and U isotopes anti
   given, together with those of the isotones N = 88 and N = 90. Shape
   phase transitions of these chains of nuclei are set by the separatrix
   and its order is compared with the experimental two nucleon separation
   energies.},
